  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nThe 20.12m/66’ ‘KATI' motor yacht built by the British shipyard Princess is available for charter for up to 6 guests in 3 cabins.\nPrimed for exploring secluded beaches and tucked-away lagoons or simply relaxing and soaking up the rays onboard, KATI is tailor-made for family fun.\nBuilt in 2017, she offers guest accommodation for up to 6 guests in 3 suites comprising a master suite, one VIP cabin and one twin cabin easily convertible into double.\nKATI comfortably cruises at 20 knots. With a shallow draft of 1.47m/4'10\" she can anchor closer to coves and sheltered bays overnight. An advanced stabilization system on board reduces the side-to-side roll of the yacht and promises guests exceptional comfort levels at anchor or when underway.\nKATI’s selection of water toys and accessories includes fishing and snorkeling equipment, paddleboards, floating lounge and WiFi connectivity. KATI also carries Williams Jet Tender to transport you with ease.\nBased in the magical waters of Southeast Asia all year round KATI is ready to take you to the stunning locations like Phi Phi, Similan, Lipe islands and many more.",
